    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/bf854ea5bd1c70884ea13cb7381868ec.avif?t=1738747581\" /></span><br><br>Ever yearn to return to the magic of the first time you played an arcade RPG like <i>Gauntlet 2</i> or <i>Golden Axe?</i> Recapture the magic in <strong>Gorgon Shield</strong>, from Oliver Joyce, creator of the beloved <i>Swords and Sandals</i> series!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b88328f454c7a2728c19e83b20631130.poster.avif?t=1738747581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b88328f454c7a2728c19e83b20631130.webm?t=1738747581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b88328f454c7a2728c19e83b20631130.mp4?t=1738747581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Up to four heroes ride on a giant shield in a tower in their quest to vanquish the mighty gorgon Medusa. Fight, heal, gain treasure, rise upwards. Each hero will eventually fall and make their way for the next heroes, but their sacrifices will not be in vain - for their treasure will pass onto the next, paving the way forward ever onward.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/14894bcd545342623206b2c510dbc27b.avif?t=1738747581\" /></span><br><br>Gather your party of expendable heroes in your quest to defeat <i>Medusa</i>! Control all four heroes as rise through the tower. Our heroes must battle waves of monsters, explore the tower's many secrets and make their way ever upward.<br><br>Your heroes will gain powerful upgrades and new allies will join you on your quest as you venture further.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b9e9056f8ee608749377e91aff865715.poster.avif?t=1738747581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b9e9056f8ee608749377e91aff865715.webm?t=1738747581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b9e9056f8ee608749377e91aff865715.mp4?t=1738747581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/ee05c43c6aa4ea932162cc8994054c2a.avif?t=1738747581\" /></span><br><br><strong>Gorgon Shield</strong> is a world first - a vertical roguelike, top down Action RPG, side scroller and survivor game all in one. Expendable heroes, powerful unlocks, simple to play but difficult to master. <br><br><i>You've never played a game like Gorgon Shield. Will you be the first to reach the top of the tower and defeat Medusa?</i><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>10 playable heroes including the priest, knight and rogue<br></li><li> The Elevator - Stand fast on the shield, protect it from enemies and gather valuable loot<br></li><li> The Labyrinths - Fast paced dungeon crawling through fiendish mazes of the tower<br></li><li> Fast paced but deeply strategic, with many party synergies and options on each run.<br></li><li> Upgrades, collectables and powers to unlock on your way to confront and defeat Medusa!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/0bfcda01b47e88853b9cbbec644606fd.avif?t=1738747581\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>As soon as you reach level 4, you will gain a second hero - then again at certain points in the quest. These extra heroes will really help share the load.<br></li><li> Keep an eye on your special powers and use them wisely. Heal when needed, use lightning to clear mobs and haste to gather loot fast.<br></li><li> The right party synergies are all important! Four barbarians might sound fun, but who will heal them when things get dire?<br></li><li> Expect your heroes to die often and early - but their upgrades will live on. No hero's death is in vain!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/bf854ea5bd1c70884ea13cb7381868ec.avif?t=1738747581\" /></span><br><br>Ever yearn to return to the magic of the first time you played an arcade RPG like <i>Gauntlet 2</i> or <i>Golden Axe?</i> Recapture the magic in <strong>Gorgon Shield</strong>, from Oliver Joyce, creator of the beloved <i>Swords and Sandals</i> series!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b88328f454c7a2728c19e83b20631130.poster.avif?t=1738747581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b88328f454c7a2728c19e83b20631130.webm?t=1738747581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b88328f454c7a2728c19e83b20631130.mp4?t=1738747581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Up to four heroes ride on a giant shield in a tower in their quest to vanquish the mighty gorgon Medusa. Fight, heal, gain treasure, rise upwards. Each hero will eventually fall and make their way for the next heroes, but their sacrifices will not be in vain - for their treasure will pass onto the next, paving the way forward ever onward.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/14894bcd545342623206b2c510dbc27b.avif?t=1738747581\" /></span><br><br>Gather your party of expendable heroes in your quest to defeat <i>Medusa</i>! Control all four heroes as rise through the tower. Our heroes must battle waves of monsters, explore the tower's many secrets and make their way ever upward.<br><br>Your heroes will gain powerful upgrades and new allies will join you on your quest as you venture further.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b9e9056f8ee608749377e91aff865715.poster.avif?t=1738747581\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b9e9056f8ee608749377e91aff865715.webm?t=1738747581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/b9e9056f8ee608749377e91aff865715.mp4?t=1738747581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/ee05c43c6aa4ea932162cc8994054c2a.avif?t=1738747581\" /></span><br><br><strong>Gorgon Shield</strong> is a world first - a vertical roguelike, top down Action RPG, side scroller and survivor game all in one. Expendable heroes, powerful unlocks, simple to play but difficult to master. <br><br><i>You've never played a game like Gorgon Shield. Will you be the first to reach the top of the tower and defeat Medusa?</i><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>10 playable heroes including the priest, knight and rogue<br></li><li> The Elevator - Stand fast on the shield, protect it from enemies and gather valuable loot<br></li><li> The Labyrinths - Fast paced dungeon crawling through fiendish mazes of the tower<br></li><li> Fast paced but deeply strategic, with many party synergies and options on each run.<br></li><li> Upgrades, collectables and powers to unlock on your way to confront and defeat Medusa!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2446920/extras/0bfcda01b47e88853b9cbbec644606fd.avif?t=1738747581\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>As soon as you reach level 4, you will gain a second hero - then again at certain points in the quest. These extra heroes will really help share the load.<br></li><li> Keep an eye on your special powers and use them wisely. Heal when needed, use lightning to clear mobs and haste to gather loot fast.<br></li><li> The right party synergies are all important! Four barbarians might sound fun, but who will heal them when things get dire?<br></li><li> Expect your heroes to die often and early - but their upgrades will live on. No hero's death is in vain!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Gather your party of expendable heroes. Climb a vast tower atop a shiny shield. Who will fight? Who will heal? Who will laze around and take all the treasure? The choices will be yours alone, but only those who work together will be powerful enough to face Medusa at the top of the GORGON SHIELD.",
